      "cat-harness:section": "(footer)",
      "prov:value": "*Most of what this README says from \"What it does\" onwards was the checkout root's README until 2026-10-09, when that file became a rendered index of the instances (`bun run cat index:render`); the original is kept verbatim on the `fsh-guts` state branch (`separated/root-README.md`).*",
